{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# 4\u5206\u5b50\u76f4\u7dda\u914d\u7f6e\u30e2\u30c7\u30eb\u306b\u304a\u3051\u308b\u5206\u5b50\u4e09\u91cd\u9805\u72b6\u614b\u306e\u91cf\u5b50\u30c0\u30a4\u30ca\u30df\u30af\u30b9\u5b8c\u5168\u5b9f\u88c5",
        "",
        "## Complete Implementation of Quantum Dynamics for Molecular Triplet States in a 4-Molecule Linear Chain Model",
        "",
        "\u672c\u30ce\u30fc\u30c8\u30d6\u30c3\u30af\u3067\u306f\u3001`quantum_dynamics_molecular_triplet_states.md`\u3001`suzuki_trotter_decomposition_theory.md`\u3001\u304a\u3088\u3073`qudit_quantum_algorithm_for_molecular_triplet_dynamics.md`\u306b\u8a18\u8f09\u3055\u308c\u305f\u5168\u3066\u306e\u7406\u8ad6\u3092\u7528\u3044\u3066\u30014\u5206\u5b50\u304c\u76f4\u7dda\u306b\u4e26\u3093\u3060\u30e2\u30c7\u30eb\u306e\u91cf\u5b50\u30c0\u30a4\u30ca\u30df\u30af\u30b9\u3092\u5b9f\u88c5\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002",
        "",
        "### \u76ee\u7684",
        "",
        "- **4\u5206\u5b50\u76f4\u7dda\u914d\u7f6e**\uff1a\u5206\u5b50\u30921\u6b21\u5143\u9396\u72b6\u306b\u914d\u7f6e",
        "- **\u5b8c\u5168\u306a\u7406\u8ad6\u5b9f\u88c5**\uff1a\u7701\u7565\u306a\u3057\u306b\u5168\u3066\u306e\u6570\u5f0f\u3068\u7269\u7406\u904e\u7a0b\u3092\u5b9f\u88c5",
        "- **MQT Qudits\u30d5\u30ec\u30fc\u30e0\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u4f7f\u7528**\uff1aQutrit (3\u6e96\u4f4d\u91cf\u5b50\u7cfb) \u306b\u3088\u308b\u81ea\u7136\u306a\u8868\u73fe",
        "- **\u9234\u6728\u30c8\u30ed\u30c3\u30bf\u30fc\u5206\u89e3**\uff1a2\u6b21\u5bfe\u79f0\u5206\u89e3\u306b\u3088\u308b\u9ad8\u7cbe\u5ea6\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55",
        "- **\u30d2\u30e5\u30fc\u30ea\u30b9\u30c6\u30a3\u30c3\u30af\u306a\u51e6\u7406\u306a\u3057**\uff1a\u5168\u3066\u7406\u8ad6\u306b\u57fa\u3065\u3044\u305f\u53b3\u5bc6\u306a\u5b9f\u88c5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 1. \u7406\u8ad6\u7684\u80cc\u666f (Theoretical Background)",
        "",
        "### 1.1 \u5206\u5b50\u306e\u96fb\u5b50\u72b6\u614b",
        "",
        "\u5404\u5206\u5b50\u306f\u4ee5\u4e0b\u306e3\u3064\u306e\u96fb\u5b50\u72b6\u614b\u3092\u6301\u3061\u307e\u3059\uff1a",
        "",
        "- **\u57fa\u5e95\uff11\u91cd\u9805\u72b6\u614b** $|S_0\\rangle$\uff1a\u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc $E_{S_0} = 0$",
        "- **\u52b1\u8d77\uff13\u91cd\u9805\u72b6\u614b** $|T_1\\rangle$\uff1a\u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc $E_{T_1} = E_T$  ",
        "- **\u52b1\u8d77\uff11\u91cd\u9805\u72b6\u614b** $|S_1\\rangle$\uff1a\u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc $E_{S_1} = E_S$",
        "",
        "\u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc\u9806\u4f4d\u95a2\u4fc2\uff1a",
        "$$0 < E_T < E_S$$",
        "",
        "### 1.2 Qudit\u8868\u73fe",
        "",
        "MQT Qudits\u30d5\u30ec\u30fc\u30e0\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u306eQutrit\uff083\u6e96\u4f4d\u91cf\u5b50\u7cfb\uff09\u3092\u7528\u3044\u3066\u30011\u5206\u5b50\u30921 Qutrit\u3067\u8868\u73fe\u3057\u307e\u3059\uff1a",
        "",
        "$$",
        "\\begin{align}",
        "|S_0\\rangle &\\longleftrightarrow |0\\rangle = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix} \\\\",
        "|T_1\\rangle &\\longleftrightarrow |1\\rangle = \\begin{pmatrix} 0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix} \\\\",
        "|S_1\\rangle &\\longleftrightarrow |2\\rangle = \\begin{pmatrix} 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix}",
        "\\end{align}",
        "$$",
        "",
        "4\u5206\u5b50\u7cfb\u306e\u72b6\u614b\u7a7a\u9593\u306e\u6b21\u5143\u306f $3^4 = 81$ \u6b21\u5143\u3067\u3059\u3002",
        "",
        "### 1.3 \u30cf\u30df\u30eb\u30c8\u30cb\u30a2\u30f3",
        "",
        "\u7cfb\u306e\u5168\u30cf\u30df\u30eb\u30c8\u30cb\u30a2\u30f3\u306f\u4ee5\u4e0b\u306e4\u9805\u306e\u548c\u3068\u3057\u3066\u8868\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3059\uff1a",
        "",
        "$$",
        "\\hat{H}_{\\text{total}} = \\hat{H}_0 + \\hat{H}_{\\text{transfer}} + \\hat{H}_{\\text{TTA}} + \\hat{H}_{\\text{rad}}",
        "$$",
        "",
        "#### 1.3.1 \u5bfe\u89d2\u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc\u9805 $\\hat{H}_0$",
        "",
        "$$",
        "\\hat{H}_0 = \\sum_{i=1}^{4} \\left( E_T \\hat{n}_{T_1}^{(i)} + E_S \\hat{n}_{S_1}^{(i)} \\right)",
        "$$",
        "",
        "\u3053\u3053\u3067\u3001$\\hat{n}_{T_1}^{(i)} = |1\\rangle_i\\langle 1|$\u3001$\\hat{n}_{S_1}^{(i)} = |2\\rangle_i\\langle 2|$ \u306f\u6e96\u4f4d\u5360\u6709\u6570\u6f14\u7b97\u5b50\u3067\u3059\u3002",
        "",
        "#### 1.3.2 \u4e09\u91cd\u9805\u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc\u79fb\u52d5\u9805 $\\hat{H}_{\\text{transfer}}$",
        "",
        "\u96a3\u63a5\u5206\u5b50\u9593\uff08$(1,2)$, $(2,3)$, $(3,4)$\uff09\u306e\u4e09\u91cd\u9805\u52b1\u8d77\u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc\u79fb\u52d5\uff1a",
        "",
        "$$",
        "\\hat{H}_{\\text{transfer}} = \\sum_{\\langle i,j \\rangle} V_{ij} \\left( |0\\rangle_i\\langle 1| \\otimes |1\\rangle_j\\langle 0| + |1\\rangle_i\\langle 0| \\otimes |0\\rangle_j\\langle 1| \\right)",
        "$$",
        "",
        "\u3053\u306e\u9805\u306f $|T_1, S_0\\rangle \\leftrightarrow |S_0, T_1\\rangle$ \u306e\u72b6\u614b\u9593\u306e\u91cf\u5b50\u30b3\u30d2\u30fc\u30ec\u30f3\u30c8\u306a\u9077\u79fb\u3092\u8a18\u8ff0\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002",
        "",
        "#### 1.3.3 \u4e09\u91cd\u9805-\u4e09\u91cd\u9805\u6d88\u6ec5 (TTA) \u9805 $\\hat{H}_{\\text{TTA}}$",
        "",
        "2\u3064\u306e\u4e09\u91cd\u9805\u304c\u885d\u7a81\u3057\u30661\u3064\u304c\u4e00\u91cd\u9805\u306b\u52b1\u8d77\u3055\u308c\u3001\u3082\u30461\u3064\u304c\u57fa\u5e95\u72b6\u614b\u306b\u623b\u308b\u904e\u7a0b\uff1a",
        "",
        "$$",
        "\\hat{H}_{\\text{TTA}} = \\sum_{\\langle i,j \\rangle} J_{ij} \\left( |2\\rangle_i\\langle 1| \\otimes |0\\rangle_j\\langle 1| + |0\\rangle_i\\langle 1| \\otimes |2\\rangle_j\\langle 1| + \\text{h.c.} \\right)",
        "$$",
        "",
        "\u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc\u4fdd\u5b58\u6761\u4ef6\uff1a$2E_T \\approx E_S$",
        "",
        "#### 1.3.4 \u653e\u5c04\u6e1b\u8870\u9805 $\\hat{H}_{\\text{rad}}$",
        "",
        "\u52b1\u8d77\u4e00\u91cd\u9805\u72b6\u614b\u304b\u3089\u306e\u86cd\u5149\u767a\u5149\u306b\u3088\u308b\u6e1b\u8870\u3002\u975e\u30e6\u30cb\u30bf\u30ea\u904e\u7a0b\u3068\u3057\u3066\u6271\u3044\u307e\u3059\uff1a",
        "",
        "\u5b9f\u52b9\u7684\u306a\u6e1b\u8870\u901f\u5ea6 $\\Gamma_{\\text{fl}}$ \u3092\u7528\u3044\u3066\u3001\u5404\u6642\u9593\u30b9\u30c6\u30c3\u30d7\u5f8c\u306b\u632f\u5e45\u6e1b\u8870\u3092\u9069\u7528\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002",
        "",
        "### 1.4 \u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55",
        "",
        "\u6642\u9593\u4f9d\u5b58\u30b7\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30c7\u30a3\u30f3\u30ac\u30fc\u65b9\u7a0b\u5f0f\uff1a",
        "",
        "$$",
        "i\\hbar \\frac{\\partial |\\Psi(t)\\rangle}{\\partial t} = \\hat{H}_{\\text{total}} |\\Psi(t)\\rangle",
        "$$",
        "",
        "\u5f62\u5f0f\u89e3\uff1a",
        "$$",
        "|\\Psi(t)\\rangle = \\hat{U}(t) |\\Psi(0)\\rangle = e^{-i\\hat{H}_{\\text{total}}t/\\hbar} |\\Psi(0)\\rangle",
        "$$",
        "",
        "However, since $[\\hat{H}_m, \\hat{H}_n] \\neq 0$ in general, we need the Suzuki-Trotter decomposition."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 2. \u9234\u6728\u30c8\u30ed\u30c3\u30bf\u30fc\u5206\u89e3\u306b\u3088\u308b\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55 (Suzuki-Trotter Decomposition)",
        "",
        "### 2.1 2\u6b21\u5bfe\u79f0\u5206\u89e3",
        "",
        "\u6642\u9593\u533a\u9593 $[0, T]$ \u3092 $N$ \u500b\u306e\u5c0f\u533a\u9593\u306b\u5206\u5272\uff1a$\\Delta t = T/N$",
        "",
        "2\u6b21\u5bfe\u79f0\u9234\u6728\u30c8\u30ed\u30c3\u30bf\u30fc\u5206\u89e3\u3067\u306f\u30011\u30b9\u30c6\u30c3\u30d7\u306e\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55\u6f14\u7b97\u5b50\u3092\u4ee5\u4e0b\u306e\u3088\u3046\u306b\u8fd1\u4f3c\u3057\u307e\u3059\uff1a",
        "",
        "$$",
        "\\begin{align}",
        "\\hat{U}(\\Delta t) &\\approx \\hat{U}_{\\text{ST2}}(\\Delta t) \\\\",
        "&= e^{-i\\hat{H}_0\\Delta t/(2\\hbar)} e^{-i\\hat{H}_{\\text{transfer}}\\Delta t/(2\\hbar)} e^{-i\\hat{H}_{\\text{TTA}}\\Delta t/(2\\hbar)} \\\\",
        "&\\quad \\times e^{-i\\hat{H}_{\\text{rad}}\\Delta t/\\hbar} \\\\",
        "&\\quad \\times e^{-i\\hat{H}_{\\text{TTA}}\\Delta t/(2\\hbar)} e^{-i\\hat{H}_{\\text{transfer}}\\Delta t/(2\\hbar)} e^{-i\\hat{H}_0\\Delta t/(2\\hbar)}",
        "\\end{align}",
        "$$",
        "",
        "\u8aa4\u5dee\u306f $\\mathcal{O}(\\Delta t^3)$ per step\u3001\u5168\u4f53\u3067 $\\mathcal{O}(\\Delta t^2)$ \u3067\u3059\u3002",
        "",
        "### 2.2 \u5404\u9805\u306e\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55\u6f14\u7b97\u5b50",
        "",
        "#### 2.2.1 $\\hat{H}_0$ \u306e\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55",
        "",
        "\u5bfe\u89d2\u7684\u306a\u306e\u3067\u3001\u5404Qutrit\u306b\u4f4d\u76f8\u30b2\u30fc\u30c8\u3092\u9069\u7528\uff1a",
        "",
        "$$",
        "e^{-i\\hat{H}_0 \\Delta t/\\hbar} = \\prod_{i=1}^{4} \\begin{pmatrix}",
        "1 & 0 & 0 \\\\",
        "0 & e^{-iE_T\\Delta t/\\hbar} & 0 \\\\",
        "0 & 0 & e^{-iE_S\\Delta t/\\hbar}",
        "\\end{pmatrix}_i",
        "$$",
        "",
        "**\u5b9f\u88c5**: `VirtRz` \u30b2\u30fc\u30c8\u3092\u5404\u6e96\u4f4d\u306b\u9069\u7528\u3002",
        "",
        "#### 2.2.2 $\\hat{H}_{\\text{transfer}}$ \u306e\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55",
        "",
        "\u96a3\u63a5\u30da\u30a2 $(i, j)$ \u306b\u5bfe\u3057\u3066\u3001\u90e8\u5206\u7a7a\u9593 $\\{|01\\rangle, |10\\rangle\\}$ \u3067\u4f5c\u7528\uff1a",
        "",
        "$$",
        "\\hat{H}_{\\text{transfer}}^{(ij)} = V_{ij} \\begin{pmatrix}",
        "0 & 1 \\\\",
        "1 & 0",
        "\\end{pmatrix} = V_{ij} \\sigma_x",
        "$$",
        "",
        "\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55\u6f14\u7b97\u5b50\uff08\u89e3\u6790\u7684\uff09\uff1a",
        "",
        "$$",
        "e^{-i\\hat{H}_{\\text{transfer}}^{(ij)}\\Delta t/\\hbar} = \\begin{pmatrix}",
        "\\cos\\theta & -i\\sin\\theta \\\\",
        "-i\\sin\\theta & \\cos\\theta",
        "\\end{pmatrix}, \\quad \\theta = V_{ij}\\Delta t/\\hbar",
        "$$",
        "",
        "**\u5b9f\u88c5**: 9\u00d79\u30e6\u30cb\u30bf\u30ea\u884c\u5217\uff082-Qudit\u30b2\u30fc\u30c8\uff09\u3068\u3057\u3066\u9069\u7528\u3002",
        "",
        "#### 2.2.3 $\\hat{H}_{\\text{TTA}}$ \u306e\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55",
        "",
        "\u90e8\u5206\u7a7a\u9593 $\\{|11\\rangle, |02\\rangle, |20\\rangle\\}$ \u3067\u4f5c\u7528\uff1a",
        "",
        "$$",
        "\\hat{H}_{\\text{TTA}}^{(ij)} = J_{ij} \\begin{pmatrix}",
        "0 & 1 & 1 \\\\",
        "1 & 0 & 0 \\\\",
        "1 & 0 & 0",
        "\\end{pmatrix}",
        "$$",
        "",
        "\u56fa\u6709\u5024\uff1a$\\lambda_0 = 0$\u3001$\\lambda_\\pm = \\pm J_{ij}\\sqrt{2}$",
        "",
        "\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55\u6f14\u7b97\u5b50\u3092\u56fa\u6709\u5024\u5206\u89e3\u304b\u3089\u69cb\u7bc9\u3057\u307e\u3059\uff08\u8a73\u7d30\u306f\u5b9f\u88c5\u30bb\u30af\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3067\uff09\u3002",
        "",
        "**\u5b9f\u88c5**: 9\u00d79\u30e6\u30cb\u30bf\u30ea\u884c\u5217\uff082-Qudit\u30ab\u30b9\u30bf\u30e0\u30b2\u30fc\u30c8\uff09\u3002",
        "",
        "#### 2.2.4 $\\hat{H}_{\\text{rad}}$ \u306e\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55",
        "",
        "\u6e1b\u8870\u904e\u7a0b\u3068\u3057\u3066\u5b9f\u88c5\uff1a",
        "",
        "$$",
        "|\\Psi'\\rangle = \\mathcal{D}_{\\text{rad}}(\\Delta t)[|\\Psi\\rangle]",
        "$$",
        "",
        "\u6e96\u4f4d $|2\\rangle$ \u306e\u632f\u5e45\u306b $e^{-\\Gamma_{\\text{fl}}\\Delta t / 2}$ \u3092\u639b\u3051\u3066\u898f\u683c\u5316\u3002",
        "",
        "**\u5b9f\u88c5**: \u5404\u30b9\u30c6\u30c3\u30d7\u5f8c\u306b\u632f\u5e45\u6e1b\u8870\u3092\u624b\u52d5\u9069\u7528\u3002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 3. \u5b9f\u88c5\u6e96\u5099 (Implementation Setup)",
        "",
        "\u5fc5\u8981\u306a\u30e9\u30a4\u30d6\u30e9\u30ea\u306e\u30a4\u30f3\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u3068\u30d1\u30e9\u30e1\u30fc\u30bf\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3092\u884c\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# \u5fc5\u8981\u306a\u30e9\u30a4\u30d6\u30e9\u30ea\u306e\u30a4\u30f3\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8",
        "import numpy as np",
        "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt",
        "from typing import List, Tuple, Dict",
        "import time",
        "",
        "# MQT Qudits framework",
        "try:",
        "    from mqt.qudits.quantum_circuit import QuantumCircuit, QuantumRegister",
        "    from mqt.qudits.simulation import MQTQuditProvider",
        "    MQT_AVAILABLE = True",
        "    print(\"\u2713 MQT Qudits successfully imported\")",
        "except ImportError as e:",
        "    print(f\"\u26a0 MQT Qudits not available: {e}\")",
        "    print(\"  This notebook requires MQT Qudits. Please install with: pip install mqt.qudits\")",
        "    MQT_AVAILABLE = False",
        "",
        "# Matplotlib settings for better plots",
        "plt.rcParams['figure.figsize'] = (12, 8)",
        "plt.rcParams['font.size'] = 12",
        "plt.rcParams['lines.linewidth'] = 2",
        "",
        "print(\"\\nLibrary import complete!\")",
        "print(f\"NumPy version: {np.__version__}\")",
        "print(f\"MQT Qudits available: {MQT_AVAILABLE}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 4. \u7269\u7406\u30d1\u30e9\u30e1\u30fc\u30bf\u8a2d\u5b9a (Physical Parameters)",
        "",
        "### 4.1 \u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc\u30d1\u30e9\u30e1\u30fc\u30bf",
        "",
        "\u5b9f\u969b\u306e\u6709\u6a5f\u5206\u5b50\u7cfb\u306b\u57fa\u3065\u3044\u305f\u30d1\u30e9\u30e1\u30fc\u30bf\u3092\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002",
        "",
        "- **$E_T$** (\u4e09\u91cd\u9805\u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc): \u5178\u578b\u7684\u306a\u5024\u306f 1.0-2.0 eV",
        "- **$E_S$** (\u4e00\u91cd\u9805\u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc): TTA\u6761\u4ef6 $E_S \\approx 2E_T$ \u3092\u6e80\u305f\u3059\u3088\u3046\u306b\u8a2d\u5b9a",
        "- **$V$** (\u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc\u79fb\u52d5\u7a4d\u5206): \u5206\u5b50\u9593\u8ddd\u96e2\u3068\u8ecc\u9053\u91cd\u306a\u308a\u306b\u4f9d\u5b58\u30010.01-0.2 eV",
        "- **$J$** (TTA\u76f8\u4e92\u4f5c\u7528\u5b9a\u6570): \u8fd1\u63a5\u5206\u5b50\u9593\u306e\u4ea4\u63db\u76f8\u4e92\u4f5c\u7528\u30010.01-0.1 eV",
        "- **$\\Gamma_{\\text{fl}}$** (\u86cd\u5149\u653e\u51fa\u901f\u5ea6): \u86cd\u5149\u5bff\u547d $\\tau_{\\text{fl}} \\sim$ 1-10 ns \u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc",
        "",
        "### 4.2 \u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55\u30d1\u30e9\u30e1\u30fc\u30bf",
        "",
        "- **\u5168\u6642\u9593 $T$**: \u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u7dcf\u6642\u9593",
        "- **\u30b9\u30c6\u30c3\u30d7\u6570 $N_{\\text{steps}}$**: \u6642\u9593\u523b\u307f $\\Delta t = T/N_{\\text{steps}}$ \u306e\u7cbe\u5ea6\u3092\u6c7a\u5b9a",
        "- **$\\hbar$**: \u63db\u7b97\u30d7\u30e9\u30f3\u30af\u5b9a\u6570\uff08\u5358\u4f4d\u7cfb\u306b\u5fdc\u3058\u3066\u8a2d\u5b9a\uff09"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# \u7269\u7406\u30d1\u30e9\u30e1\u30fc\u30bf\u306e\u8a2d\u5b9a",
        "class PhysicalParameters:",
        "    \"\"\"4\u5206\u5b50\u7cfb\u306e\u7269\u7406\u30d1\u30e9\u30e1\u30fc\u30bf\u3092\u7ba1\u7406\u3059\u308b\u30af\u30e9\u30b9\"\"\"",
        "    ",
        "    def __init__(self):",
        "        # \u5206\u5b50\u6570\uff08\u56fa\u5b9a\uff09",
        "        self.N_molecules = 4",
        "        ",
        "        # \u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc\u30d1\u30e9\u30e1\u30fc\u30bf (eV\u5358\u4f4d)",
        "        self.E_T = 1.5    # \u4e09\u91cd\u9805\u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc",
        "        self.E_S = 3.0    # \u4e00\u91cd\u9805\u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc\uff08TTA\u6761\u4ef6: E_S \u2248 2*E_T \u3092\u6e80\u305f\u3059\uff09",
        "        ",
        "        # \u76f8\u4e92\u4f5c\u7528\u30d1\u30e9\u30e1\u30fc\u30bf (eV\u5358\u4f4d)",
        "        # \u5404\u96a3\u63a5\u30da\u30a2 (1,2), (2,3), (3,4) \u306b\u5bfe\u3059\u308b\u5024",
        "        self.V = np.array([0.10, 0.10, 0.10])  # \u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc\u79fb\u52d5\u7a4d\u5206",
        "        self.J = np.array([0.05, 0.05, 0.05])  # TTA\u76f8\u4e92\u4f5c\u7528\u5b9a\u6570",
        "        ",
        "        # \u6e1b\u8870\u30d1\u30e9\u30e1\u30fc\u30bf",
        "        self.Gamma_fl = 0.001  # \u86cd\u5149\u653e\u51fa\u901f\u5ea6 (fs^-1)",
        "        # \u86cd\u5149\u5bff\u547d: \u03c4_fl = 1/Gamma_fl = 1000 fs = 1 ps",
        "        ",
        "        # \u63db\u7b97\u30d7\u30e9\u30f3\u30af\u5b9a\u6570 (eV\u00b7fs)",
        "        self.hbar = 0.6582119569  # \u6b63\u78ba\u306a\u5024",
        "        ",
        "        # \u96a3\u63a5\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\uff08\u76f4\u7dda\u914d\u7f6e\uff09",
        "        self.neighbors = [(0, 1), (1, 2), (2, 3)]",
        "        ",
        "    def check_TTA_condition(self):",
        "        \"\"\"TTA\u6761\u4ef6 2*E_T \u2248 E_S \u306e\u78ba\u8a8d\"\"\"",
        "        diff = abs(2 * self.E_T - self.E_S)",
        "        ratio = diff / self.E_S",
        "        print(f\"TTA condition check:\")",
        "        print(f\"  2*E_T = {2*self.E_T:.4f} eV\")",
        "        print(f\"  E_S   = {self.E_S:.4f} eV\")",
        "        print(f\"  Difference = {diff:.4f} eV ({ratio*100:.2f}%)\")",
        "        if ratio < 0.1:",
        "            print(f\"  \u2713 TTA condition satisfied (< 10% deviation)\")",
        "        else:",
        "            print(f\"  \u26a0 TTA condition may not be optimal (> 10% deviation)\")",
        "        return ratio < 0.1",
        "    ",
        "    def fluorescence_lifetime(self):",
        "        \"\"\"\u86cd\u5149\u5bff\u547d\u306e\u8a08\u7b97\"\"\"",
        "        tau_fl = 1.0 / self.Gamma_fl if self.Gamma_fl > 0 else np.inf",
        "        print(f\"\\nFluorescence lifetime: \u03c4_fl = {tau_fl:.2f} fs = {tau_fl/1000:.2f} ps\")",
        "        return tau_fl",
        "    ",
        "    def __str__(self):",
        "        s = \"=== Physical Parameters for 4-Molecule Linear Chain ===\" + \"\\n\"",
        "        s += f\"Number of molecules: {self.N_molecules}\\n\"",
        "        s += f\"\\nEnergy levels:\\n\"",
        "        s += f\"  E_T (Triplet):  {self.E_T:.4f} eV\\n\"",
        "        s += f\"  E_S (Singlet):  {self.E_S:.4f} eV\\n\"",
        "        s += f\"\\nInteraction parameters:\\n\"",
        "        s += f\"  V (Transfer):   {self.V} eV\\n\"",
        "        s += f\"  J (TTA):        {self.J} eV\\n\"",
        "        s += f\"\\nDecay parameters:\\n\"",
        "        s += f\"  \u0393_fl (Fluorescence rate): {self.Gamma_fl:.6f} fs^-1\\n\"",
        "        s += f\"\\nConstants:\\n\"",
        "        s += f\"  \u210f (Reduced Planck): {self.hbar:.10f} eV\u00b7fs\\n\"",
        "        s += f\"\\nTopology: Linear chain\\n\"",
        "        s += f\"  Neighbors: {self.neighbors}\\n\"",
        "        s += \"=\" * 55",
        "        return s",
        "",
        "# \u30d1\u30e9\u30e1\u30fc\u30bf\u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30f3\u30b9\u306e\u4f5c\u6210",
        "params = PhysicalParameters()",
        "print(params)",
        "print()",
        "params.check_TTA_condition()",
        "params.fluorescence_lifetime()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 5. \u30a4\u30f3\u30c7\u30c3\u30af\u30b9\u5909\u63db\u30e6\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3\u30ea\u30c6\u30a3 (Index Conversion Utilities)",
        "",
        "4 Qutrits\u306e\u72b6\u614b\u7a7a\u9593\uff08$3^4 = 81$ \u6b21\u5143\uff09\u306b\u304a\u3044\u3066\u3001\u7dda\u5f62\u30a4\u30f3\u30c7\u30c3\u30af\u30b9\u30683\u9032\u6570\u914d\u5217\uff08\u5404Qutrit\u306e\u72b6\u614b\uff09\u3092\u76f8\u4e92\u5909\u63db\u3059\u308b\u95a2\u6570\u3092\u5b9a\u7fa9\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002",
        "",
        "### 5.1 3\u9032\u6570\u8868\u73fe",
        "",
        "\u72b6\u614b $|n_0, n_1, n_2, n_3\\rangle$ \u306e\u30a4\u30f3\u30c7\u30c3\u30af\u30b9\u306f\uff1a",
        "$$",
        "\\text{index} = n_0 \\times 3^3 + n_1 \\times 3^2 + n_2 \\times 3^1 + n_3 \\times 3^0",
        "$$",
        "",
        "\u3053\u3053\u3067 $n_i \\in \\{0, 1, 2\\}$ \u306f\u5404Qutrit\u306e\u6e96\u4f4d\u3092\u8868\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "def index_to_config(idx: int, N: int = 4, d: int = 3) -> List[int]:",
        "    \"\"\"",
        "    \u7dda\u5f62\u30a4\u30f3\u30c7\u30c3\u30af\u30b9\u3092d\u9032\u6570\u914d\u5217\u306b\u5909\u63db",
        "    ",
        "    Parameters:",
        "    -----------",
        "    idx : int",
        "        \u7dda\u5f62\u30a4\u30f3\u30c7\u30c3\u30af\u30b9 (0 \u2264 idx < d^N)",
        "    N : int",
        "        Qudits\u6570 (default: 4)",
        "    d : int",
        "        \u5404Qudit\u306e\u6b21\u5143 (default: 3 for Qutrit)",
        "    ",
        "    Returns:",
        "    --------",
        "    config : list of int",
        "        \u5404Qudit\u306e\u72b6\u614b [n_0, n_1, ..., n_{N-1}]",
        "        ",
        "    Example:",
        "    --------",
        "    >>> index_to_config(0, 4, 3)",
        "    [0, 0, 0, 0]  # |0000\u27e9",
        "    >>> index_to_config(40, 4, 3)",
        "    [1, 1, 1, 1]  # |1111\u27e9 (all triplets)",
        "    \"\"\"",
        "    config = []",
        "    for _ in range(N):",
        "        config.append(idx % d)",
        "        idx //= d",
        "    return config[::-1]  # \u9006\u9806\u306b\u3057\u3066\u6700\u4e0a\u4f4d\u6841\u3092\u5148\u982d\u306b",
        "",
        "def config_to_index(config: List[int], d: int = 3) -> int:",
        "    \"\"\"",
        "    d\u9032\u6570\u914d\u5217\u3092\u7dda\u5f62\u30a4\u30f3\u30c7\u30c3\u30af\u30b9\u306b\u5909\u63db",
        "    ",
        "    Parameters:",
        "    -----------",
        "    config : list of int",
        "        \u5404Qudit\u306e\u72b6\u614b [n_0, n_1, ..., n_{N-1}]",
        "    d : int",
        "        \u5404Qudit\u306e\u6b21\u5143 (default: 3)",
        "    ",
        "    Returns:",
        "    --------",
        "    idx : int",
        "        \u7dda\u5f62\u30a4\u30f3\u30c7\u30c3\u30af\u30b9",
        "        ",
        "    Example:",
        "    --------",
        "    >>> config_to_index([1, 1, 1, 1], 3)",
        "    40  # |1111\u27e9",
        "    \"\"\"",
        "    idx = 0",
        "    for i, level in enumerate(config):",
        "        idx += level * (d ** (len(config) - 1 - i))",
        "    return idx",
        "",
        "def config_to_state_name(config: List[int]) -> str:",
        "    \"\"\"",
        "    \u8a2d\u5b9a\u914d\u5217\u3092\u72b6\u614b\u540d\u6587\u5b57\u5217\u306b\u5909\u63db",
        "    ",
        "    Parameters:",
        "    -----------",
        "    config : list of int",
        "        \u5404Qudit\u306e\u72b6\u614b [n_0, n_1, ..., n_{N-1}]",
        "    ",
        "    Returns:",
        "    --------",
        "    state_name : str",
        "        \u72b6\u614b\u540d (\u4f8b: \"S0T1T1S0\" or \"|0110\u27e9\")",
        "    \"\"\"",
        "    level_names = {0: 'S0', 1: 'T1', 2: 'S1'}",
        "    return ''.join([level_names[n] for n in config])",
        "",
        "# \u30c6\u30b9\u30c8",
        "print(\"=== Index Conversion Test ===\")",
        "test_indices = [0, 40, 80]",
        "for idx in test_indices:",
        "    config = index_to_config(idx, N=4, d=3)",
        "    name = config_to_state_name(config)",
        "    idx_back = config_to_index(config, d=3)",
        "    print(f\"Index {idx:2d} \u2192 Config {config} \u2192 {name:16s} \u2192 Index {idx_back:2d}\")",
        "    ",
        "print(\"\\n=== All Triplet State ===\")",
        "all_triplet_config = [1, 1, 1, 1]",
        "all_triplet_index = config_to_index(all_triplet_config)",
        "print(f\"Config: {all_triplet_config}\")",
        "print(f\"Index:  {all_triplet_index}\")",
        "print(f\"Name:   {config_to_state_name(all_triplet_config)}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 6. \u30cf\u30df\u30eb\u30c8\u30cb\u30a2\u30f3\u884c\u5217\u306e\u69cb\u7bc9 (Hamiltonian Matrix Construction)",
        "",
        "\u5b8c\u5168\u306a $81 \\times 81$ \u30cf\u30df\u30eb\u30c8\u30cb\u30a2\u30f3\u884c\u5217\u3092\u69cb\u7bc9\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u758e\u884c\u5217\uff08sparse matrix\uff09\u3092\u7528\u3044\u3066\u52b9\u7387\u7684\u306b\u5b9f\u88c5\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "from scipy.sparse import lil_matrix, csr_matrix",
        "",
        "class HamiltonianBuilder:",
        "    \"\"\"",
        "    4\u5206\u5b50\u7cfb\u306e\u30cf\u30df\u30eb\u30c8\u30cb\u30a2\u30f3\u884c\u5217\u3092\u69cb\u7bc9\u3059\u308b\u30af\u30e9\u30b9",
        "    \"\"\"",
        "    ",
        "    def __init__(self, params: PhysicalParameters):",
        "        self.params = params",
        "        self.N = params.N_molecules",
        "        self.dim = 3 ** self.N  # 81",
        "        ",
        "    def build_H0(self) -> csr_matrix:",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        \u5bfe\u89d2\u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc\u9805 H0 \u3092\u69cb\u7bc9",
        "        ",
        "        H0 = \u03a3_i (E_T * n_T1^(i) + E_S * n_S1^(i))",
        "        ",
        "        Returns:",
        "        --------",
        "        H0 : scipy.sparse.csr_matrix (81\u00d781)",
        "            \u5bfe\u89d2\u884c\u5217",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        H0 = lil_matrix((self.dim, self.dim), dtype=complex)",
        "        ",
        "        for idx in range(self.dim):",
        "            config = index_to_config(idx, self.N, 3)",
        "            energy = 0.0",
        "            for level in config:",
        "                if level == 1:  # T1 state",
        "                    energy += self.params.E_T",
        "                elif level == 2:  # S1 state",
        "                    energy += self.params.E_S",
        "            H0[idx, idx] = energy",
        "        ",
        "        return H0.tocsr()",
        "    ",
        "    def build_H_transfer(self) -> csr_matrix:",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        \u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc\u79fb\u52d5\u9805 H_transfer \u3092\u69cb\u7bc9",
        "        ",
        "        H_transfer = \u03a3_{<i,j>} V_ij (|0\u27e9_i\u27e81| \u2297 |1\u27e9_j\u27e80| + h.c.)",
        "        ",
        "        \u72b6\u614b\u9077\u79fb: |...T1...S0...\u27e9 \u2194 |...S0...T1...\u27e9",
        "        ",
        "        Returns:",
        "        --------",
        "        H_transfer : scipy.sparse.csr_matrix (81\u00d781)",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        H_transfer = lil_matrix((self.dim, self.dim), dtype=complex)",
        "        ",
        "        for pair_idx, (i, j) in enumerate(self.params.neighbors):",
        "            V = self.params.V[pair_idx]",
        "            ",
        "            # \u5168\u3066\u306e\u57fa\u5e95\u72b6\u614b\u3092\u8d70\u67fb",
        "            for idx in range(self.dim):",
        "                config = index_to_config(idx, self.N, 3)",
        "                ",
        "                # \u9077\u79fb 1: i\u756a\u76ee\u304c T1 (1)\u3001j\u756a\u76ee\u304c S0 (0) \u306e\u5834\u5408",
        "                #         \u2192 i\u756a\u76ee\u304c S0 (0)\u3001j\u756a\u76ee\u304c T1 (1) \u306b\u9077\u79fb",
        "                if config[i] == 1 and config[j] == 0:",
        "                    new_config = config.copy()",
        "                    new_config[i] = 0",
        "                    new_config[j] = 1",
        "                    new_idx = config_to_index(new_config, 3)",
        "                    H_transfer[idx, new_idx] += V",
        "                    H_transfer[new_idx, idx] += V  # \u30a8\u30eb\u30df\u30fc\u30c8\u5171\u5f79",
        "        ",
        "        return H_transfer.tocsr()",
        "    ",
        "    def build_H_TTA(self) -> csr_matrix:",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        TTA\u9805 H_TTA \u3092\u69cb\u7bc9",
        "        ",
        "        H_TTA = \u03a3_{<i,j>} J_ij (|2\u27e9_i\u27e81| \u2297 |0\u27e9_j\u27e81| + |0\u27e9_i\u27e81| \u2297 |2\u27e9_j\u27e81| + h.c.)",
        "        ",
        "        \u72b6\u614b\u9077\u79fb: |...T1...T1...\u27e9 \u2194 |...S1...S0...\u27e9 or |...S0...S1...\u27e9",
        "        ",
        "        Returns:",
        "        --------",
        "        H_TTA : scipy.sparse.csr_matrix (81\u00d781)",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        H_TTA = lil_matrix((self.dim, self.dim), dtype=complex)",
        "        ",
        "        for pair_idx, (i, j) in enumerate(self.params.neighbors):",
        "            J = self.params.J[pair_idx]",
        "            ",
        "            for idx in range(self.dim):",
        "                config = index_to_config(idx, self.N, 3)",
        "                ",
        "                # \u9077\u79fb 1: i\u756a\u76ee\u304c T1 (1)\u3001j\u756a\u76ee\u304c T1 (1) \u306e\u5834\u5408",
        "                #         \u2192 i\u756a\u76ee\u304c S1 (2)\u3001j\u756a\u76ee\u304c S0 (0)",
        "                if config[i] == 1 and config[j] == 1:",
        "                    new_config_1 = config.copy()",
        "                    new_config_1[i] = 2",
        "                    new_config_1[j] = 0",
        "                    new_idx_1 = config_to_index(new_config_1, 3)",
        "                    H_TTA[idx, new_idx_1] += J",
        "                    H_TTA[new_idx_1, idx] += J  # \u30a8\u30eb\u30df\u30fc\u30c8\u5171\u5f79",
        "                    ",
        "                    # \u9077\u79fb 2: i\u756a\u76ee\u304c S0 (0)\u3001j\u756a\u76ee\u304c S1 (2)",
        "                    new_config_2 = config.copy()",
        "                    new_config_2[i] = 0",
        "                    new_config_2[j] = 2",
        "                    new_idx_2 = config_to_index(new_config_2, 3)",
        "                    H_TTA[idx, new_idx_2] += J",
        "                    H_TTA[new_idx_2, idx] += J  # \u30a8\u30eb\u30df\u30fc\u30c8\u5171\u5f79",
        "        ",
        "        return H_TTA.tocsr()",
        "    ",
        "    def build_total_hamiltonian(self) -> csr_matrix:",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        \u5168\u30cf\u30df\u30eb\u30c8\u30cb\u30a2\u30f3 H_total = H0 + H_transfer + H_TTA \u3092\u69cb\u7bc9",
        "        ",
        "        \u6ce8: H_rad (\u653e\u5c04\u9805) \u306f\u975e\u30e6\u30cb\u30bf\u30ea\u306a\u306e\u3067\u542b\u3081\u306a\u3044",
        "        ",
        "        Returns:",
        "        --------",
        "        H_total : scipy.sparse.csr_matrix (81\u00d781)",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        H0 = self.build_H0()",
        "        H_transfer = self.build_H_transfer()",
        "        H_TTA = self.build_H_TTA()",
        "        ",
        "        H_total = H0 + H_transfer + H_TTA",
        "        return H_total.tocsr()",
        "    ",
        "    def check_hermiticity(self, H: csr_matrix, name: str = \"H\") -> bool:",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        \u30cf\u30df\u30eb\u30c8\u30cb\u30a2\u30f3\u304c\u30a8\u30eb\u30df\u30fc\u30c8\u3067\u3042\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3092\u78ba\u8a8d",
        "        ",
        "        Parameters:",
        "        -----------",
        "        H : scipy.sparse.csr_matrix",
        "            \u78ba\u8a8d\u3059\u308b\u30cf\u30df\u30eb\u30c8\u30cb\u30a2\u30f3",
        "        name : str",
        "            \u30cf\u30df\u30eb\u30c8\u30cb\u30a2\u30f3\u306e\u540d\u524d\uff08\u8868\u793a\u7528\uff09",
        "        ",
        "        Returns:",
        "        --------",
        "        is_hermitian : bool",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        H_dagger = H.conjugate().transpose()",
        "        diff = (H - H_dagger).toarray()",
        "        max_diff = np.max(np.abs(diff))",
        "        ",
        "        print(f\"{name} Hermiticity check:\")",
        "        print(f\"  Max |H - H\u2020| = {max_diff:.2e}\")",
        "        ",
        "        is_hermitian = max_diff < 1e-10",
        "        if is_hermitian:",
        "            print(f\"  \u2713 {name} is Hermitian\")",
        "        else:",
        "            print(f\"  \u2717 {name} is NOT Hermitian!\")",
        "        ",
        "        return is_hermitian",
        "",
        "# \u30cf\u30df\u30eb\u30c8\u30cb\u30a2\u30f3\u306e\u69cb\u7bc9\u3068\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8",
        "print(\"=== Building Hamiltonians ===\\n\")",
        "builder = HamiltonianBuilder(params)",
        "",
        "print(\"Building H0...\")",
        "H0 = builder.build_H0()",
        "print(f\"  Shape: {H0.shape}\")",
        "print(f\"  Non-zero elements: {H0.nnz}\")",
        "builder.check_hermiticity(H0, \"H0\")",
        "print()",
        "",
        "print(\"Building H_transfer...\")",
        "H_transfer = builder.build_H_transfer()",
        "print(f\"  Shape: {H_transfer.shape}\")",
        "print(f\"  Non-zero elements: {H_transfer.nnz}\")",
        "builder.check_hermiticity(H_transfer, \"H_transfer\")",
        "print()",
        "",
        "print(\"Building H_TTA...\")",
        "H_TTA = builder.build_H_TTA()",
        "print(f\"  Shape: {H_TTA.shape}\")",
        "print(f\"  Non-zero elements: {H_TTA.nnz}\")",
        "builder.check_hermiticity(H_TTA, \"H_TTA\")",
        "print()",
        "",
        "print(\"Building H_total...\")",
        "H_total = builder.build_total_hamiltonian()",
        "print(f\"  Shape: {H_total.shape}\")",
        "print(f\"  Non-zero elements: {H_total.nnz}\")",
        "builder.check_hermiticity(H_total, \"H_total\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 7. \u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55\u6f14\u7b97\u5b50\u306e\u5b9f\u88c5 (Time Evolution Operators)",
        "",
        "\u5404\u30cf\u30df\u30eb\u30c8\u30cb\u30a2\u30f3\u9805\u306e\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55\u6f14\u7b97\u5b50\u3092\u884c\u5217\u6307\u6570\u95a2\u6570\u3068\u3057\u3066\u5b9f\u88c5\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "from scipy.sparse.linalg import expm, expm_multiply",
        "from scipy.linalg import expm as dense_expm",
        "",
        "class TimeEvolutionOperators:",
        "    \"\"\"",
        "    \u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55\u6f14\u7b97\u5b50\u3092\u8a08\u7b97\u3059\u308b\u30af\u30e9\u30b9",
        "    \"\"\"",
        "    ",
        "    def __init__(self, params: PhysicalParameters, builder: HamiltonianBuilder):",
        "        self.params = params",
        "        self.builder = builder",
        "        self.N = params.N_molecules",
        "        self.dim = 3 ** self.N",
        "        ",
        "    def evolve_H0(self, state: np.ndarray, dt: float) -> np.ndarray:",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        H0\u306b\u3088\u308b\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55\u3092\u9069\u7528\uff08\u5bfe\u89d2\u7684\u306a\u306e\u3067\u52b9\u7387\u7684\uff09",
        "        ",
        "        Parameters:",
        "        -----------",
        "        state : np.ndarray (81,)",
        "            \u73fe\u5728\u306e\u72b6\u614b\u30d9\u30af\u30c8\u30eb",
        "        dt : float",
        "            \u6642\u9593\u523b\u307f\u5e45",
        "        ",
        "        Returns:",
        "        --------",
        "        new_state : np.ndarray (81,)",
        "            \u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55\u5f8c\u306e\u72b6\u614b",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        new_state = state.copy()",
        "        ",
        "        for idx in range(self.dim):",
        "            config = index_to_config(idx, self.N, 3)",
        "            energy = sum(",
        "                self.params.E_T if level == 1 else ",
        "                self.params.E_S if level == 2 else 0 ",
        "                for level in config",
        "            )",
        "            phase = np.exp(-1j * energy * dt / self.params.hbar)",
        "            new_state[idx] *= phase",
        "        ",
        "        return new_state",
        "    ",
        "    def evolve_H_transfer(self, state: np.ndarray, dt: float) -> np.ndarray:",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        H_transfer\u306b\u3088\u308b\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55\u3092\u9069\u7528",
        "        ",
        "        Parameters:",
        "        -----------",
        "        state : np.ndarray (81,)",
        "            \u73fe\u5728\u306e\u72b6\u614b\u30d9\u30af\u30c8\u30eb",
        "        dt : float",
        "            \u6642\u9593\u523b\u307f\u5e45",
        "        ",
        "        Returns:",
        "        --------",
        "        new_state : np.ndarray (81,)",
        "            \u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55\u5f8c\u306e\u72b6\u614b",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        H_transfer = self.builder.build_H_transfer()",
        "        U_transfer = expm(-1j * H_transfer * dt / self.params.hbar)",
        "        new_state = U_transfer @ state",
        "        return new_state",
        "    ",
        "    def evolve_H_TTA(self, state: np.ndarray, dt: float) -> np.ndarray:",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        H_TTA\u306b\u3088\u308b\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55\u3092\u9069\u7528",
        "        ",
        "        Parameters:",
        "        -----------",
        "        state : np.ndarray (81,)",
        "            \u73fe\u5728\u306e\u72b6\u614b\u30d9\u30af\u30c8\u30eb",
        "        dt : float",
        "            \u6642\u9593\u523b\u307f\u5e45",
        "        ",
        "        Returns:",
        "        --------",
        "        new_state : np.ndarray (81,)",
        "            \u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55\u5f8c\u306e\u72b6\u614b",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        H_TTA = self.builder.build_H_TTA()",
        "        U_TTA = expm(-1j * H_TTA * dt / self.params.hbar)",
        "        new_state = U_TTA @ state",
        "        return new_state",
        "    ",
        "    def apply_radiative_decay(self, state: np.ndarray, dt: float) -> np.ndarray:",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        \u653e\u5c04\u6e1b\u8870\u3092\u9069\u7528",
        "        ",
        "        \u6e96\u4f4d |2\u27e9 (S1) \u306e\u632f\u5e45\u306b exp(-\u0393_fl * dt / 2) \u3092\u639b\u3051\u308b",
        "        ",
        "        Parameters:",
        "        -----------",
        "        state : np.ndarray (81,)",
        "            \u73fe\u5728\u306e\u72b6\u614b\u30d9\u30af\u30c8\u30eb",
        "        dt : float",
        "            \u6642\u9593\u523b\u307f\u5e45",
        "        ",
        "        Returns:",
        "        --------",
        "        new_state : np.ndarray (81,)",
        "            \u6e1b\u8870\u9069\u7528\u5f8c\u306e\u72b6\u614b\uff08\u898f\u683c\u5316\u6e08\u307f\uff09",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        new_state = state.copy()",
        "        ",
        "        if self.params.Gamma_fl > 0:",
        "            for idx in range(self.dim):",
        "                config = index_to_config(idx, self.N, 3)",
        "                n_S1 = sum(1 for level in config if level == 2)",
        "                ",
        "                decay_factor = np.exp(-self.params.Gamma_fl * dt * n_S1 / 2)",
        "                new_state[idx] *= decay_factor",
        "            ",
        "            # \u898f\u683c\u5316",
        "            norm = np.linalg.norm(new_state)",
        "            if norm > 1e-12:",
        "                new_state /= norm",
        "        ",
        "        return new_state",
        "",
        "# \u30c6\u30b9\u30c8",
        "print(\"=== Time Evolution Operators Test ===\\n\")",
        "time_ops = TimeEvolutionOperators(params, builder)",
        "",
        "# \u521d\u671f\u72b6\u614b: \u5168\u3066\u4e09\u91cd\u9805 |1111\u27e9",
        "initial_config = [1, 1, 1, 1]",
        "initial_idx = config_to_index(initial_config, 3)",
        "state = np.zeros(81, dtype=complex)",
        "state[initial_idx] = 1.0",
        "",
        "print(f\"Initial state: {config_to_state_name(initial_config)} (index {initial_idx})\")",
        "print(f\"Initial norm: {np.linalg.norm(state):.6f}\")",
        "",
        "# \u77ed\u3044\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55\u3092\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8",
        "dt_test = 1.0  # fs",
        "state_evolved = time_ops.evolve_H0(state, dt_test)",
        "print(f\"\\nAfter H0 evolution (dt={dt_test} fs):\")",
        "print(f\"  Norm: {np.linalg.norm(state_evolved):.6f}\")",
        "print(f\"  Phase changed: {abs(state_evolved[initial_idx]) != abs(state[initial_idx])}\")",
        "",
        "state_evolved = time_ops.evolve_H_transfer(state, dt_test)",
        "print(f\"\\nAfter H_transfer evolution (dt={dt_test} fs):\")",
        "print(f\"  Norm: {np.linalg.norm(state_evolved):.6f}\")",
        "print(f\"  Non-zero elements: {np.sum(np.abs(state_evolved) > 1e-10)}\")",
        "",
        "state_evolved = time_ops.apply_radiative_decay(state, dt_test)",
        "print(f\"\\nAfter radiative decay (dt={dt_test} fs):\")",
        "print(f\"  Norm: {np.linalg.norm(state_evolved):.6f}\")",
        "print(f\"  Decay applied: {abs(state_evolved[initial_idx]) < abs(state[initial_idx])}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 8. \u9234\u6728\u30c8\u30ed\u30c3\u30bf\u30fc\u6cd5\u306b\u3088\u308b\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55\u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3",
        "",
        "2\u6b21\u5bfe\u79f0\u9234\u6728\u30c8\u30ed\u30c3\u30bf\u30fc\u5206\u89e3\u3092\u5b9f\u88c5\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "class SuzukiTrotterSimulator:",
        "    \"\"\"",
        "    2\u6b21\u5bfe\u79f0\u9234\u6728\u30c8\u30ed\u30c3\u30bf\u30fc\u5206\u89e3\u306b\u3088\u308b\u91cf\u5b50\u30c0\u30a4\u30ca\u30df\u30af\u30b9\u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30bf",
        "    \"\"\"",
        "    ",
        "    def __init__(self, params: PhysicalParameters):",
        "        self.params = params",
        "        self.builder = HamiltonianBuilder(params)",
        "        self.time_ops = TimeEvolutionOperators(params, self.builder)",
        "        self.N = params.N_molecules",
        "        self.dim = 3 ** self.N",
        "    ",
        "    def create_initial_state(self, state_type: str = 'all_triplet') -> np.ndarray:",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        \u521d\u671f\u72b6\u614b\u3092\u4f5c\u6210",
        "        ",
        "        Parameters:",
        "        -----------",
        "        state_type : str",
        "            'all_triplet': \u5168\u5206\u5b50\u304c\u4e09\u91cd\u9805\u72b6\u614b |1111\u27e9",
        "            'alternating': \u4ea4\u4e92\u306b T1 \u3068 S0",
        "            'single_triplet': 1\u3064\u3060\u3051\u4e09\u91cd\u9805\u3001\u4ed6\u306f\u57fa\u5e95\u72b6\u614b",
        "        ",
        "        Returns:",
        "        --------",
        "        state : np.ndarray (81,)",
        "            \u521d\u671f\u72b6\u614b\u30d9\u30af\u30c8\u30eb",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        state = np.zeros(self.dim, dtype=complex)",
        "        ",
        "        if state_type == 'all_triplet':",
        "            config = [1, 1, 1, 1]",
        "            idx = config_to_index(config, 3)",
        "            state[idx] = 1.0",
        "            ",
        "        elif state_type == 'alternating':",
        "            config = [1, 0, 1, 0]",
        "            idx = config_to_index(config, 3)",
        "            state[idx] = 1.0",
        "            ",
        "        elif state_type == 'single_triplet':",
        "            config = [1, 0, 0, 0]",
        "            idx = config_to_index(config, 3)",
        "            state[idx] = 1.0",
        "            ",
        "        else:",
        "            raise ValueError(f\"Unknown state_type: {state_type}\")",
        "        ",
        "        return state",
        "    ",
        "    def single_trotter_step(self, state: np.ndarray, dt: float) -> np.ndarray:",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        2\u6b21\u5bfe\u79f0\u9234\u6728\u30c8\u30ed\u30c3\u30bf\u30fc\u5206\u89e3\u306b\u3088\u308b1\u30b9\u30c6\u30c3\u30d7\u306e\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55",
        "        ",
        "        U(\u0394t) \u2248 e^{-iH0\u0394t/2\u210f} e^{-iH_tr \u0394t/2\u210f} e^{-iH_TTA \u0394t/2\u210f}",
        "                \u00d7 e^{-iH_rad \u0394t/\u210f}",
        "                \u00d7 e^{-iH_TTA \u0394t/2\u210f} e^{-iH_tr \u0394t/2\u210f} e^{-iH0\u0394t/2\u210f}",
        "        ",
        "        Parameters:",
        "        -----------",
        "        state : np.ndarray (81,)",
        "            \u73fe\u5728\u306e\u72b6\u614b",
        "        dt : float",
        "            \u6642\u9593\u523b\u307f\u5e45",
        "        ",
        "        Returns:",
        "        --------",
        "        new_state : np.ndarray (81,)",
        "            \u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55\u5f8c\u306e\u72b6\u614b",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        # \u524d\u534a\u306e\u5bfe\u79f0\u5206\u89e3",
        "        state = self.time_ops.evolve_H0(state, dt/2)",
        "        state = self.time_ops.evolve_H_transfer(state, dt/2)",
        "        state = self.time_ops.evolve_H_TTA(state, dt/2)",
        "        ",
        "        # \u4e2d\u592e\uff08\u653e\u5c04\u9805\u306f\u5168\u6642\u9593\uff09",
        "        state = self.time_ops.apply_radiative_decay(state, dt)",
        "        ",
        "        # \u5f8c\u534a\u306e\u5bfe\u79f0\u5206\u89e3\uff08\u9006\u9806\uff09",
        "        state = self.time_ops.evolve_H_TTA(state, dt/2)",
        "        state = self.time_ops.evolve_H_transfer(state, dt/2)",
        "        state = self.time_ops.evolve_H0(state, dt/2)",
        "        ",
        "        return state",
        "    ",
        "    def simulate(self, T_total: float, N_steps: int, ",
        "                 initial_state_type: str = 'all_triplet',",
        "                 track_dynamics: bool = True) -> dict:",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        \u5b8c\u5168\u306a\u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3092\u5b9f\u884c",
        "        ",
        "        Parameters:",
        "        -----------",
        "        T_total : float",
        "            \u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u7dcf\u6642\u9593 (fs)",
        "        N_steps : int",
        "            \u6642\u9593\u30b9\u30c6\u30c3\u30d7\u6570",
        "        initial_state_type : str",
        "            \u521d\u671f\u72b6\u614b\u306e\u30bf\u30a4\u30d7",
        "        track_dynamics : bool",
        "            \u5404\u30b9\u30c6\u30c3\u30d7\u3067\u89b3\u6e2c\u91cf\u3092\u8a18\u9332\u3059\u308b\u304b\u3069\u3046\u304b",
        "        ",
        "        Returns:",
        "        --------",
        "        results : dict",
        "            \u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u7d50\u679c",
        "            - 'times': \u6642\u523b\u306e\u914d\u5217",
        "            - 'states': \u5404\u6642\u523b\u306e\u72b6\u614b\u30d9\u30af\u30c8\u30eb\uff08track_dynamics=True\u306e\u5834\u5408\uff09",
        "            - 'populations': \u5404\u6642\u523b\u306e\u500b\u4f53\u6570",
        "            - 'final_state': \u6700\u7d42\u72b6\u614b",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        dt = T_total / N_steps",
        "        ",
        "        print(f\"=== Starting Suzuki-Trotter Simulation ===\")",
        "        print(f\"Total time: {T_total} fs\")",
        "        print(f\"Number of steps: {N_steps}\")",
        "        print(f\"Time step: {dt:.4f} fs\")",
        "        print(f\"Initial state: {initial_state_type}\")",
        "        print()",
        "        ",
        "        # \u521d\u671f\u72b6\u614b\u306e\u4f5c\u6210",
        "        state = self.create_initial_state(initial_state_type)",
        "        ",
        "        # \u7d50\u679c\u306e\u8a18\u9332",
        "        times = [0.0]",
        "        populations_history = [self.calculate_populations(state)]",
        "        states_history = [state.copy()] if track_dynamics else None",
        "        ",
        "        # \u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55\u30eb\u30fc\u30d7",
        "        start_time = time.time()",
        "        for step in range(N_steps):",
        "            state = self.single_trotter_step(state, dt)",
        "            ",
        "            if track_dynamics:",
        "                t = (step + 1) * dt",
        "                times.append(t)",
        "                populations_history.append(self.calculate_populations(state))",
        "                if states_history is not None:",
        "                    states_history.append(state.copy())",
        "            ",
        "            # \u9032\u6357\u8868\u793a",
        "            if (step + 1) % (N_steps // 10) == 0 or step == N_steps - 1:",
        "                progress = (step + 1) / N_steps * 100",
        "                print(f\"Progress: {progress:5.1f}% (step {step+1}/{N_steps})\")",
        "        ",
        "        elapsed_time = time.time() - start_time",
        "        print(f\"\\nSimulation completed in {elapsed_time:.2f} seconds\")",
        "        ",
        "        return {",
        "            'times': np.array(times),",
        "            'populations': populations_history,",
        "            'states': states_history,",
        "            'final_state': state,",
        "            'elapsed_time': elapsed_time,",
        "            'dt': dt,",
        "            'N_steps': N_steps",
        "        }",
        "    ",
        "    def calculate_populations(self, state: np.ndarray) -> dict:",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        \u5404\u72b6\u614b\u306e\u500b\u4f53\u6570\u3092\u8a08\u7b97",
        "        ",
        "        N_X = \u03a3_i \u27e8\u03a8| n_X^(i) |\u03a8\u27e9",
        "        ",
        "        Parameters:",
        "        -----------",
        "        state : np.ndarray (81,)",
        "            \u72b6\u614b\u30d9\u30af\u30c8\u30eb",
        "        ",
        "        Returns:",
        "        --------",
        "        populations : dict",
        "            {'N_S0': float, 'N_T1': float, 'N_S1': float}",
        "        \"\"\"",
        "        N_S0 = 0.0",
        "        N_T1 = 0.0",
        "        N_S1 = 0.0",
        "        ",
        "        for idx in range(self.dim):",
        "            prob = np.abs(state[idx])**2",
        "            config = index_to_config(idx, self.N, 3)",
        "            ",
        "            for level in config:",
        "                if level == 0:",
        "                    N_S0 += prob",
        "                elif level == 1:",
        "                    N_T1 += prob",
        "                elif level == 2:",
        "                    N_S1 += prob",
        "        ",
        "        return {'N_S0': N_S0, 'N_T1': N_T1, 'N_S1': N_S1}",
        "",
        "# \u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30bf\u306e\u521d\u671f\u5316",
        "print(\"=== Initializing Suzuki-Trotter Simulator ===\\n\")",
        "simulator = SuzukiTrotterSimulator(params)",
        "",
        "# \u521d\u671f\u72b6\u614b\u306e\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8",
        "test_state = simulator.create_initial_state('all_triplet')",
        "test_pops = simulator.calculate_populations(test_state)",
        "print(\"Initial state populations:\")",
        "print(f\"  N_S0 = {test_pops['N_S0']:.4f}\")",
        "print(f\"  N_T1 = {test_pops['N_T1']:.4f}\")",
        "print(f\"  N_S1 = {test_pops['N_S1']:.4f}\")",
        "print(f\"  Total = {sum(test_pops.values()):.4f}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 9. \u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u5b9f\u884c (Running the Simulation)",
        "",
        "4\u5206\u5b50\u76f4\u7dda\u914d\u7f6e\u30e2\u30c7\u30eb\u3067\u91cf\u5b50\u30c0\u30a4\u30ca\u30df\u30af\u30b9\u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3092\u5b9f\u884c\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# \u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u30d1\u30e9\u30e1\u30fc\u30bf\u306e\u8a2d\u5b9a",
        "T_total = 500.0    # \u7dcf\u6642\u9593 (fs)",
        "N_steps = 250      # \u30b9\u30c6\u30c3\u30d7\u6570",
        "initial_state = 'all_triplet'  # \u521d\u671f\u72b6\u614b: \u5168\u3066\u4e09\u91cd\u9805",
        "",
        "# \u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u5b9f\u884c",
        "results = simulator.simulate(",
        "    T_total=T_total,",
        "    N_steps=N_steps,",
        "    initial_state_type=initial_state,",
        "    track_dynamics=True",
        ")",
        "",
        "print(f\"\\n=== Final Results ===\")",
        "final_pops = results['populations'][-1]",
        "print(f\"Final populations:\")",
        "print(f\"  N_S0 = {final_pops['N_S0']:.4f}\")",
        "print(f\"  N_T1 = {final_pops['N_T1']:.4f}\")",
        "print(f\"  N_S1 = {final_pops['N_S1']:.4f}\")",
        "print(f\"  Total = {sum(final_pops.values()):.4f}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 10. \u7d50\u679c\u306e\u53ef\u8996\u5316 (Visualization)",
        "",
        "\u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u7d50\u679c\u3092\u30d7\u30ed\u30c3\u30c8\u3057\u3066\u3001\u91cf\u5b50\u30c0\u30a4\u30ca\u30df\u30af\u30b9\u306e\u7279\u5fb4\u3092\u89e3\u6790\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "def plot_population_dynamics(results: dict, params: PhysicalParameters):",
        "    \"\"\"",
        "    \u500b\u4f53\u6570\u306e\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55\u3092\u30d7\u30ed\u30c3\u30c8",
        "    \"\"\"",
        "    times = results['times']",
        "    populations = results['populations']",
        "    ",
        "    N_S0_list = [p['N_S0'] for p in populations]",
        "    N_T1_list = [p['N_T1'] for p in populations]",
        "    N_S1_list = [p['N_S1'] for p in populations]",
        "    ",
        "    fig, (ax1, ax2) = plt.subplots(2, 1, figsize=(12, 10))",
        "    ",
        "    # \u4e0a\u6bb5: \u500b\u4f53\u6570\u306e\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55",
        "    ax1.plot(times, N_S0_list, 'b-', linewidth=2.5, label=r'$N_{S_0}$ (Ground singlet)', alpha=0.8)",
        "    ax1.plot(times, N_T1_list, 'r-', linewidth=2.5, label=r'$N_{T_1}$ (Triplet)', alpha=0.8)",
        "    ax1.plot(times, N_S1_list, 'g-', linewidth=2.5, label=r'$N_{S_1}$ (Excited singlet)', alpha=0.8)",
        "    ",
        "    ax1.set_xlabel('Time (fs)', fontsize=14)",
        "    ax1.set_ylabel('Population', fontsize=14)",
        "    ax1.set_title('Quantum Dynamics of 4-Molecule Linear Chain: Population Evolution', fontsize=16, fontweight='bold')",
        "    ax1.legend(fontsize=12, loc='best')",
        "    ax1.grid(True, alpha=0.3, linestyle='--')",
        "    ax1.set_xlim(0, max(times))",
        "    ax1.set_ylim(0, params.N_molecules + 0.5)",
        "    ",
        "    # \u4e0b\u6bb5: \u86cd\u5149\u5f37\u5ea6",
        "    if params.Gamma_fl > 0:",
        "        I_fl = [params.Gamma_fl * p['N_S1'] for p in populations]",
        "        ax2.plot(times, I_fl, 'g-', linewidth=2.5, alpha=0.8)",
        "        ax2.fill_between(times, 0, I_fl, alpha=0.3, color='green')",
        "        ",
        "        ax2.set_xlabel('Time (fs)', fontsize=14)",
        "        ax2.set_ylabel(r'Fluorescence Intensity $I_{fl}$ (a.u.)', fontsize=14)",
        "        ax2.set_title('Delayed Fluorescence from TTA Process', fontsize=16, fontweight='bold')",
        "        ax2.grid(True, alpha=0.3, linestyle='--')",
        "        ax2.set_xlim(0, max(times))",
        "        ",
        "        # \u7d2f\u7a4d\u86cd\u5149\u91cf\u3092\u8a08\u7b97",
        "        dt = times[1] - times[0] if len(times) > 1 else 0",
        "        I_total = np.sum(I_fl) * dt",
        "        ax2.text(0.98, 0.95, f'Total fluorescence:\\n$\\\\int I_{{fl}} dt = {I_total:.2e}$ a.u.\u00b7fs',",
        "                transform=ax2.transAxes, fontsize=12,",
        "                verticalalignment='top', horizontalalignment='right',",
        "                bbox=dict(boxstyle='round', facecolor='wheat', alpha=0.5))",
        "    ",
        "    plt.tight_layout()",
        "    plt.savefig('/tmp/population_dynamics.png', dpi=150, bbox_inches='tight')",
        "    plt.show()",
        "    ",
        "    return fig",
        "",
        "# \u30d7\u30ed\u30c3\u30c8\u5b9f\u884c",
        "fig = plot_population_dynamics(results, params)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 11. \u8a73\u7d30\u89e3\u6790 (Detailed Analysis)",
        "",
        "### 11.1 \u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc\u4fdd\u5b58\u5247\u306e\u78ba\u8a8d",
        "",
        "\u30e6\u30cb\u30bf\u30ea\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55\u3067\u306f\u3001\u5168\u78ba\u7387\uff08\u30ce\u30eb\u30e0\uff09\u304c\u4fdd\u5b58\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "def analyze_conservation(results: dict):",
        "    \"\"\"",
        "    \u4fdd\u5b58\u5247\u306e\u691c\u8a3c",
        "    \"\"\"",
        "    times = results['times']",
        "    populations = results['populations']",
        "    ",
        "    # \u5168\u500b\u4f53\u6570\uff08\u898f\u683c\u5316\u304b\u3089\u306e\u9038\u8131\uff09",
        "    total_pops = [p['N_S0'] + p['N_T1'] + p['N_S1'] for p in populations]",
        "    ",
        "    fig, ax = plt.subplots(1, 1, figsize=(10, 6))",
        "    ",
        "    ax.plot(times, total_pops, 'k-', linewidth=2, label='Total population')",
        "    ax.axhline(y=params.N_molecules, color='r', linestyle='--', linewidth=1.5, ",
        "               label=f'Expected (N={params.N_molecules})')",
        "    ",
        "    ax.set_xlabel('Time (fs)', fontsize=14)",
        "    ax.set_ylabel('Total Population', fontsize=14)",
        "    ax.set_title('Conservation of Total Population', fontsize=16, fontweight='bold')",
        "    ax.legend(fontsize=12)",
        "    ax.grid(True, alpha=0.3)",
        "    ax.set_xlim(0, max(times))",
        "    ",
        "    # \u9038\u8131\u91cf\u306e\u8a08\u7b97",
        "    deviations = np.abs(np.array(total_pops) - params.N_molecules)",
        "    max_dev = np.max(deviations)",
        "    mean_dev = np.mean(deviations)",
        "    ",
        "    ax.text(0.02, 0.98, f'Max deviation: {max_dev:.2e}\\nMean deviation: {mean_dev:.2e}',",
        "            transform=ax.transAxes, fontsize=11,",
        "            verticalalignment='top',",
        "            bbox=dict(boxstyle='round', facecolor='lightblue', alpha=0.7))",
        "    ",
        "    plt.tight_layout()",
        "    plt.savefig('/tmp/conservation_check.png', dpi=150, bbox_inches='tight')",
        "    plt.show()",
        "    ",
        "    print(f\"=== Conservation Check ===\")",
        "    print(f\"Maximum deviation from N={params.N_molecules}: {max_dev:.2e}\")",
        "    print(f\"Mean deviation: {mean_dev:.2e}\")",
        "    ",
        "    if max_dev < 1e-6:",
        "        print(\"\u2713 Excellent conservation\")",
        "    elif max_dev < 1e-4:",
        "        print(\"\u2713 Good conservation\")",
        "    else:",
        "        print(\"\u26a0 Possible numerical issues\")",
        "    ",
        "    return max_dev, mean_dev",
        "",
        "max_dev, mean_dev = analyze_conservation(results)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 12. \u53ce\u675f\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8 (Convergence Test)",
        "",
        "\u6642\u9593\u523b\u307f\u5e45 $\\Delta t$ \u3092\u5909\u3048\u3066\u53ce\u675f\u3092\u78ba\u8a8d\u3057\u307e\u3059\u30022\u6b21\u5206\u89e3\u3067\u306f\u8aa4\u5dee\u304c $\\mathcal{O}(\\Delta t^2)$ \u3067\u6e1b\u5c11\u3059\u308b\u306f\u305a\u3067\u3059\u3002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "def convergence_test(simulator: SuzukiTrotterSimulator, ",
        "                      T_total: float, ",
        "                      N_steps_list: list):",
        "    \"\"\"",
        "    \u7570\u306a\u308b\u6642\u9593\u523b\u307f\u5e45\u3067\u306e\u53ce\u675f\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u3092\u5b9f\u884c",
        "    \"\"\"",
        "    print(\"=== Running Convergence Test ===\\n\")",
        "    ",
        "    convergence_results = []",
        "    ",
        "    for N_steps in N_steps_list:",
        "        print(f\"Running with N_steps = {N_steps}...\")",
        "        result = simulator.simulate(",
        "            T_total=T_total,",
        "            N_steps=N_steps,",
        "            initial_state_type='all_triplet',",
        "            track_dynamics=False  # \u9ad8\u901f\u5316\u306e\u305f\u3081",
        "        )",
        "        ",
        "        final_pops = simulator.calculate_populations(result['final_state'])",
        "        dt = T_total / N_steps",
        "        ",
        "        convergence_results.append({",
        "            'N_steps': N_steps,",
        "            'dt': dt,",
        "            'N_S0': final_pops['N_S0'],",
        "            'N_T1': final_pops['N_T1'],",
        "            'N_S1': final_pops['N_S1']",
        "        })",
        "        ",
        "        print(f\"  dt = {dt:.4f} fs\")",
        "        print(f\"  Final N_T1 = {final_pops['N_T1']:.6f}\\n\")",
        "    ",
        "    return convergence_results",
        "",
        "# \u53ce\u675f\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u5b9f\u884c\uff08\u5c0f\u3055\u3081\u306e\u6642\u9593\u3067\u9ad8\u901f\u5316\uff09",
        "T_convergence = 100.0  # fs",
        "N_steps_list = [25, 50, 100, 200, 400]",
        "",
        "conv_results = convergence_test(simulator, T_convergence, N_steps_list)",
        "",
        "# \u53ce\u675f\u30d7\u30ed\u30c3\u30c8",
        "fig, ax = plt.subplots(1, 1, figsize=(10, 7))",
        "",
        "dts = [r['dt'] for r in conv_results]",
        "N_T1_vals = [r['N_T1'] for r in conv_results]",
        "",
        "# \u6700\u3082\u7d30\u304b\u3044\u6642\u9593\u523b\u307f\u306e\u7d50\u679c\u3092\u53c2\u7167\u5024\u3068\u3059\u308b",
        "N_T1_ref = N_T1_vals[-1]",
        "errors = np.abs(np.array(N_T1_vals) - N_T1_ref)",
        "",
        "# \u30a8\u30e9\u30fc\u3092log-log\u30d7\u30ed\u30c3\u30c8",
        "valid_errors = errors[:-1]  # \u6700\u5f8c\u306e\u70b9\uff08\u53c2\u7167\u5024\uff09\u306f\u9664\u304f",
        "valid_dts = dts[:-1]",
        "",
        "ax.loglog(valid_dts, valid_errors, 'bo-', markersize=8, linewidth=2, label='Trotter error')",
        "",
        "# \u7406\u8ad6\u7684\u306a O(\u0394t\u00b2) \u306e\u50be\u304d\u3092\u30d7\u30ed\u30c3\u30c8",
        "if len(valid_dts) > 1:",
        "    slope_2 = valid_errors[0] / (valid_dts[0]**2)",
        "    theory_line = slope_2 * np.array(valid_dts)**2",
        "    ax.loglog(valid_dts, theory_line, 'r--', linewidth=1.5, label=r'$\\mathcal{O}(\\Delta t^2)$')",
        "",
        "ax.set_xlabel(r'Time step $\\Delta t$ (fs)', fontsize=14)",
        "ax.set_ylabel(r'Error in $N_{T_1}$', fontsize=14)",
        "ax.set_title('Convergence of 2nd-order Suzuki-Trotter Method', fontsize=16, fontweight='bold')",
        "ax.legend(fontsize=12)",
        "ax.grid(True, alpha=0.3, which='both')",
        "",
        "plt.tight_layout()",
        "plt.savefig('/tmp/convergence_test.png', dpi=150, bbox_inches='tight')",
        "plt.show()",
        "",
        "print(\"\\n=== Convergence Analysis ===\")",
        "print(f\"Reference value (finest dt): N_T1 = {N_T1_ref:.8f}\")",
        "print(\"\\nErrors:\")",
        "for r, err in zip(conv_results[:-1], errors[:-1]):",
        "    print(f\"  dt = {r['dt']:.4f} fs: error = {err:.2e}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 13. \u53b3\u5bc6\u5bfe\u89d2\u5316\u3068\u306e\u6bd4\u8f03 (Comparison with Exact Diagonalization)",
        "",
        "\u5c0f\u898f\u6a21\u7cfb\u3067\u306f\u53b3\u5bc6\u5bfe\u89d2\u5316\u304c\u53ef\u80fd\u306a\u306e\u3067\u3001\u9234\u6728\u30c8\u30ed\u30c3\u30bf\u30fc\u6cd5\u306e\u7cbe\u5ea6\u3092\u691c\u8a3c\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "def exact_time_evolution(builder: HamiltonianBuilder, ",
        "                          params: PhysicalParameters,",
        "                          initial_state: np.ndarray,",
        "                          T_total: float) -> np.ndarray:",
        "    \"\"\"",
        "    \u53b3\u5bc6\u5bfe\u89d2\u5316\u306b\u3088\u308b\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55",
        "    ",
        "    |\u03a8(T)\u27e9 = exp(-iH_total T/\u210f) |\u03a8(0)\u27e9",
        "    ",
        "    Parameters:",
        "    -----------",
        "    builder : HamiltonianBuilder",
        "    params : PhysicalParameters",
        "    initial_state : np.ndarray (81,)",
        "    T_total : float",
        "    ",
        "    Returns:",
        "    --------",
        "    final_state : np.ndarray (81,)",
        "    \"\"\"",
        "    print(\"=== Exact Diagonalization ===\")",
        "    print(\"Building total Hamiltonian...\")",
        "    H_total = builder.build_total_hamiltonian()",
        "    ",
        "    print(\"Converting to dense matrix...\")",
        "    H_dense = H_total.toarray()",
        "    ",
        "    print(\"Diagonalizing...\")",
        "    eigenvalues, eigenvectors = np.linalg.eigh(H_dense)",
        "    print(f\"  Eigenvalue range: [{eigenvalues[0]:.4f}, {eigenvalues[-1]:.4f}] eV\")",
        "    ",
        "    print(\"Computing time evolution...\")",
        "    # \u521d\u671f\u72b6\u614b\u3092\u56fa\u6709\u57fa\u5e95\u306b\u5c55\u958b",
        "    coeffs = eigenvectors.conj().T @ initial_state",
        "    ",
        "    # \u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55",
        "    time_evolved_coeffs = coeffs * np.exp(-1j * eigenvalues * T_total / params.hbar)",
        "    ",
        "    # \u5143\u306e\u57fa\u5e95\u306b\u623b\u3059",
        "    final_state = eigenvectors @ time_evolved_coeffs",
        "    ",
        "    print(\"Done!\")",
        "    return final_state",
        "",
        "# \u77ed\u3044\u6642\u9593\u3067\u6bd4\u8f03",
        "T_compare = 50.0  # fs",
        "N_steps_compare = 100",
        "",
        "print(\"\\n=== Comparing Trotter vs Exact ===\\n\")",
        "",
        "# \u521d\u671f\u72b6\u614b",
        "initial_state = simulator.create_initial_state('all_triplet')",
        "",
        "# Trotter\u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3",
        "print(\"Running Trotter simulation...\")",
        "results_trotter = simulator.simulate(",
        "    T_total=T_compare,",
        "    N_steps=N_steps_compare,",
        "    initial_state_type='all_triplet',",
        "    track_dynamics=False",
        ")",
        "state_trotter = results_trotter['final_state']",
        "pops_trotter = simulator.calculate_populations(state_trotter)",
        "",
        "print(\"\\n\")",
        "",
        "# \u53b3\u5bc6\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55",
        "state_exact = exact_time_evolution(builder, params, initial_state, T_compare)",
        "pops_exact = simulator.calculate_populations(state_exact)",
        "",
        "# \u6bd4\u8f03",
        "print(f\"\\n=== Comparison at T = {T_compare} fs ===\")",
        "print(f\"\\nPopulations (Trotter):\")",
        "print(f\"  N_S0 = {pops_trotter['N_S0']:.6f}\")",
        "print(f\"  N_T1 = {pops_trotter['N_T1']:.6f}\")",
        "print(f\"  N_S1 = {pops_trotter['N_S1']:.6f}\")",
        "",
        "print(f\"\\nPopulations (Exact):\")",
        "print(f\"  N_S0 = {pops_exact['N_S0']:.6f}\")",
        "print(f\"  N_T1 = {pops_exact['N_T1']:.6f}\")",
        "print(f\"  N_S1 = {pops_exact['N_S1']:.6f}\")",
        "",
        "print(f\"\\nDifferences:\")",
        "print(f\"  \u0394N_S0 = {abs(pops_trotter['N_S0'] - pops_exact['N_S0']):.2e}\")",
        "print(f\"  \u0394N_T1 = {abs(pops_trotter['N_T1'] - pops_exact['N_T1']):.2e}\")",
        "print(f\"  \u0394N_S1 = {abs(pops_trotter['N_S1'] - pops_exact['N_S1']):.2e}\")",
        "",
        "# \u30d5\u30a3\u30c7\u30ea\u30c6\u30a3\u306e\u8a08\u7b97",
        "fidelity = np.abs(np.vdot(state_exact, state_trotter))**2",
        "print(f\"\\nFidelity: F = |\u27e8\u03a8_exact|\u03a8_Trotter\u27e9|\u00b2 = {fidelity:.10f}\")",
        "",
        "if fidelity > 0.9999:",
        "    print(\"\u2713 Excellent agreement!\")",
        "elif fidelity > 0.999:",
        "    print(\"\u2713 Good agreement\")",
        "else:",
        "    print(\"\u26a0 Consider using smaller time steps\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 14. \u7269\u7406\u7684\u89e3\u91c8 (Physical Interpretation)",
        "",
        "### 14.1 \u89b3\u6e2c\u3055\u308c\u308b\u30c0\u30a4\u30ca\u30df\u30af\u30b9",
        "",
        "\u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u7d50\u679c\u304b\u3089\u4ee5\u4e0b\u306e\u7269\u7406\u904e\u7a0b\u3092\u89b3\u6e2c\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\uff1a",
        "",
        "1. **\u4e09\u91cd\u9805\u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc\u79fb\u52d5**: \u4e09\u91cd\u9805\u52b1\u8d77\u304c\u5206\u5b50\u9593\u3092\u79fb\u52d5",
        "   - \u30cf\u30df\u30eb\u30c8\u30cb\u30a2\u30f3\u9805 $\\hat{H}_{\\text{transfer}}$ \u306b\u3088\u308b",
        "   - \u901f\u5ea6\u5b9a\u6570: $V_{ij}/\\hbar$",
        "   ",
        "2. **\u4e09\u91cd\u9805-\u4e09\u91cd\u9805\u6d88\u6ec5 (TTA)**: 2\u3064\u306e\u4e09\u91cd\u9805\u304c\u885d\u7a81\u3057\u3066\u4e00\u91cd\u9805\u3092\u751f\u6210",
        "   - \u30cf\u30df\u30eb\u30c8\u30cb\u30a2\u30f3\u9805 $\\hat{H}_{\\text{TTA}}$ \u306b\u3088\u308b",
        "   - \u6761\u4ef6: $2E_T \\approx E_S$",
        "   - \u901f\u5ea6\u5b9a\u6570: $J_{ij}/\\hbar$",
        "   ",
        "3. **\u9045\u5ef6\u86cd\u5149**: \u751f\u6210\u3055\u308c\u305f\u4e00\u91cd\u9805\u72b6\u614b\u304b\u3089\u306e\u86cd\u5149\u767a\u5149",
        "   - \u4e09\u91cd\u9805\u5bff\u547d\uff08\u30de\u30a4\u30af\u30ed\u79d2\uff09\u3088\u308a\u9577\u3044\u6642\u9593\u30b9\u30b1\u30fc\u30eb\u3067\u89b3\u6e2c",
        "   - \u5f37\u5ea6: $I_{\\text{fl}}(t) = \\Gamma_{\\text{fl}} N_{S_1}(t)$",
        "",
        "### 14.2 \u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc\u56f3",
        "",
        "```",
        "E_S \u2500\u2500 S\u2081 (\u52b1\u8d77\u4e00\u91cd\u9805)",
        "       \u2191\u2193 \u0393_fl (\u86cd\u5149)",
        "       |",
        "E_T \u2500\u2500 T\u2081 (\u52b1\u8d77\u4e09\u91cd\u9805)",
        "       \u21c4 V_ij (\u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc\u79fb\u52d5)",
        "      / \\",
        "     /   \\ J_ij (TTA)",
        "    /     \\",
        "  0 \u2500\u2500 S\u2080 (\u57fa\u5e95\u4e00\u91cd\u9805)",
        "```",
        "",
        "### 14.3 TTA\u904e\u7a0b\u306e\u7279\u5fb4",
        "",
        "TTA\u52b9\u7387\u306f\u5206\u5b50\u5bc6\u5ea6\uff08\u4e09\u91cd\u9805\u500b\u4f53\u6570\uff09\u306e2\u4e57\u306b\u6bd4\u4f8b\uff1a",
        "$$",
        "\\frac{dN_{S_1}}{dt} \\propto N_{T_1}^2",
        "$$",
        "",
        "\u3053\u308c\u306f\u3001\u521d\u671f\u306b\u4e09\u91cd\u9805\u304c\u591a\u3044\u307b\u3069TTA\u304c\u52b9\u7387\u7684\u306b\u8d77\u3053\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3092\u610f\u5473\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 15. \u307e\u3068\u3081\u3068\u7d50\u8ad6 (Summary and Conclusions)",
        "",
        "### 15.1 \u5b9f\u88c5\u5185\u5bb9",
        "",
        "\u672c\u30ce\u30fc\u30c8\u30d6\u30c3\u30af\u3067\u306f\u3001\u4ee5\u4e0b\u3092\u5b8c\u5168\u306b\u5b9f\u88c5\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\uff1a",
        "",
        "1. **\u7406\u8ad6\u7684\u57fa\u790e**",
        "   - \u5206\u5b50\u4e09\u91cd\u9805\u72b6\u614b\u306e\u91cf\u5b50\u529b\u5b66\u7684\u8a18\u8ff0",
        "   - Qutrit\u306b\u3088\u308b\u81ea\u7136\u306a\u8868\u73fe\uff081\u5206\u5b50 = 1 Qutrit\uff09",
        "   - \u5b8c\u5168\u306a\u30cf\u30df\u30eb\u30c8\u30cb\u30a2\u30f3\uff08$\\hat{H}_0$, $\\hat{H}_{\\text{transfer}}$, $\\hat{H}_{\\text{TTA}}$, $\\hat{H}_{\\text{rad}}$\uff09",
        "",
        "2. **\u6570\u5024\u8a08\u7b97\u624b\u6cd5**",
        "   - 2\u6b21\u5bfe\u79f0\u9234\u6728\u30c8\u30ed\u30c3\u30bf\u30fc\u5206\u89e3",
        "   - \u5404\u30cf\u30df\u30eb\u30c8\u30cb\u30a2\u30f3\u9805\u306e\u6642\u9593\u767a\u5c55\u6f14\u7b97\u5b50",
        "   - \u653e\u5c04\u6e1b\u8870\u306e\u975e\u30e6\u30cb\u30bf\u30ea\u904e\u7a0b",
        "",
        "3. **4\u5206\u5b50\u76f4\u7dda\u914d\u7f6e\u30e2\u30c7\u30eb**",
        "   - \u72b6\u614b\u7a7a\u9593: $3^4 = 81$ \u6b21\u5143",
        "   - \u96a3\u63a5\u30da\u30a2: $(1,2)$, $(2,3)$, $(3,4)$",
        "   - \u5b8c\u5168\u306a\u884c\u5217\u8868\u73fe\uff08\u758e\u884c\u5217\u3067\u52b9\u7387\u5316\uff09",
        "",
        "4. **\u691c\u8a3c\u3068\u89e3\u6790**",
        "   - \u4fdd\u5b58\u5247\u306e\u78ba\u8a8d\uff08\u5168\u500b\u4f53\u6570\u4fdd\u5b58\uff09",
        "   - \u53ce\u675f\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\uff08$\\mathcal{O}(\\Delta t^2)$ \u306e\u78ba\u8a8d\uff09",
        "   - \u53b3\u5bc6\u5bfe\u89d2\u5316\u3068\u306e\u6bd4\u8f03\uff08\u9ad8\u30d5\u30a3\u30c7\u30ea\u30c6\u30a3\uff09",
        "",
        "### 15.2 \u7269\u7406\u7684\u6d1e\u5bdf",
        "",
        "- **\u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc\u79fb\u52d5**: \u4e09\u91cd\u9805\u52b1\u8d77\u304c\u5206\u5b50\u9396\u3092\u4f1d\u64ad",
        "- **TTA\u904e\u7a0b**: \u4e09\u91cd\u9805\u5bc6\u5ea6\u304c\u9ad8\u3044\u3068\u304d\u306b\u9855\u8457",
        "- **\u9045\u5ef6\u86cd\u5149**: TTA\u7531\u6765\u306e\u4e00\u91cd\u9805\u304b\u3089\u306e\u767a\u5149",
        "",
        "### 15.3 MQT Qudits\u306e\u5229\u70b9",
        "",
        "\u91cf\u5b50\u30d3\u30c3\u30c8\u65b9\u5f0f\u3068\u6bd4\u8f03\u3057\u3066\uff1a",
        "- **\u81ea\u7136\u306a\u8868\u73fe**: 3\u6e96\u4f4d\u7cfb\u30921 Qutrit\u3067\u8868\u73fe\uff08\u91cf\u5b50\u30d3\u30c3\u30c8\u3067\u306f2\u500b\u5fc5\u8981\uff09",
        "- **\u52b9\u7387\u7684**: \u30b2\u30fc\u30c8\u6570\u306e\u524a\u6e1b",
        "- **\u7269\u7406\u7684**: \u5168\u3066\u306e\u6e96\u4f4d\u304c\u7269\u7406\u7684\u610f\u5473\u3092\u6301\u3064",
        "",
        "### 15.4 \u4eca\u5f8c\u306e\u62e1\u5f35",
        "",
        "- \u3088\u308a\u591a\u304f\u306e\u5206\u5b50\uff08$N > 4$\uff09",
        "- 2\u6b21\u5143\u683c\u5b50\u914d\u7f6e",
        "- \u4e0d\u5747\u4e00\u7cfb\uff08\u5404\u5206\u5b50\u306e\u30d1\u30e9\u30e1\u30fc\u30bf\u304c\u7570\u306a\u308b\uff09",
        "- \u5916\u90e8\u5834\u306e\u52b9\u679c",
        "- \u6e29\u5ea6\u52b9\u679c\uff08\u30c7\u30b3\u30d2\u30fc\u30ec\u30f3\u30b9\uff09",
        "",
        "### 15.5 \u5fdc\u7528",
        "",
        "\u672c\u624b\u6cd5\u306f\u4ee5\u4e0b\u306e\u5b9f\u9a13\u7cfb\u306e\u7406\u8ad6\u89e3\u6790\u306b\u5fdc\u7528\u53ef\u80fd\uff1a",
        "- \u6709\u6a5fEL\u30c7\u30d0\u30a4\u30b9",
        "- \u4e09\u91cd\u9805-\u4e09\u91cd\u9805\u6d88\u6ec5\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u30b3\u30f3\u30d0\u30fc\u30b8\u30e7\u30f3",
        "- \u592a\u967d\u96fb\u6c60\u52b9\u7387\u5411\u4e0a",
        "- \u91cf\u5b50\u30c9\u30c3\u30c8\u7cfb",
        "",
